[00:00.000]...
[00:37.373]Wouldn't it be nice to take a walk on some pure white sand
{"漫步在纯白沙滩上该有多美好"}
[00:41.992]Gaze at the horizon
{"凝望海天交界线"}
[00:44.237]Without living in fear?
{"不必活在恐惧中？"}
[00:46.542]Wouldn't be sweet to watch the sun curve down meets the waves?
{"看夕阳弯入浪尖该有多甜蜜"}
[00:51.446]And taste the ocean spray
{"轻尝飞溅的浪花"}
[00:53.831]And realize we'd been living as slaves
{"才惊觉我们一直活得像奴隶"}
[00:59.257]We've got to learn to get back, get back
{"我们必须学会回归 回归"}
[01:01.514]But is it worth the price of our soul?
{"但这值得以灵魂为代价吗？"}
[01:03.778]You know you had to kill her, kill her!
{"你知道你必须杀了她 杀了她！"}
[01:06.167]Oh my dirty hands, it never fades
{"啊我这双脏手 永远洗不净"}
[01:08.886]And if we get out, get out
{"若我们能逃离 逃离"}
[01:10.567]I'll think about the price of our soul
{"我会思考灵魂的代价"}
[01:12.929]We've got to learn to live free, live free
{"我们必须学会自由地活 自由地活"}
[01:15.254]We'll live a life without barricades
{"我们将过上毫无阻碍的生活"}
[01:17.520]...
[01:41.333]How long I haven't seen the light shine through in my life
{"多久未见光芒照亮我生命"}
[01:45.934]Lost everything, family, confusion on the way
{"失去一切 家人 途中充满迷茫"}
[01:50.491]Someone tries to talk to me and signpost the righteous road
{"有人试图指引我走向正途"}
[01:55.533]My animal inside
{"我内心的兽性"}
[01:57.824]Can now be tamed to go
{"如今可被驯服"}
[01:59.376]Over the wall
{"翻越高墙"}
[02:03.161]We've got to learn to get back, get back
{"我们必须学会回归 回归"}
